{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you destroy humanity?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patient Zero Pandemic Simulator is an intense virus simulator with strategic elements, where your goal is to create a deadly disease and bring it to a global catastrophe. Starting with &quot;patient zero,&quot; you must adapt the virus, evolving it to overcome all the barriers humanity puts in place to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETAILED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hyper-realistic world where every infection is influenced by a variety of factors, from climate and transportation to healthcare and population density.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/d3dd6baa25300bc99c382f1942667739.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/d3dd6baa25300bc99c382f1942667739.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/d3dd6baa25300bc99c382f1942667739.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>15 TYPES OF DISEASES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infect the world by choosing from 15 disease types, each with unique mutations and developmental possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/82b77d7884889c66ada1a0613144ffec.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/82b77d7884889c66ada1a0613144ffec.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/82b77d7884889c66ada1a0613144ffec.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LARGE INFECTION MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infect all countries, interact with hundreds of traits, and create diverse virus-spreading scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/bba8d9ee6d54b1cfa221183ae8a0bbd4.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/bba8d9ee6d54b1cfa221183ae8a0bbd4.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/bba8d9ee6d54b1cfa221183ae8a0bbd4.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GLOBAL EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for global catastrophes and decide how to adapt your pathogen to government actions and changing conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/08c51bd0d6b4f38857d07944358b8353.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/08c51bd0d6b4f38857d07944358b8353.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/08c51bd0d6b4f38857d07944358b8353.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRATEGY AND TACTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save the world or destroy it? Develop your plague, plan your moves, and determine the fate of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/f82d2737ef95d524ee0a25da86d80a93.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/f82d2737ef95d524ee0a25da86d80a93.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/f82d2737ef95d524ee0a25da86d80a93.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624090?t=1771487857","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624090?t=1771487857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/b074f9f41b9a23b493ec9af47ae494c2ec9684ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771487857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/b074f9f41b9a23b493ec9af47ae494c2ec9684ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771487857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you destroy humanity?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patient Zero Pandemic Simulator is an intense virus simulator with strategic elements, where your goal is to create a deadly disease and bring it to a global catastrophe. Starting with &quot;patient zero,&quot; you must adapt the virus, evolving it to overcome all the barriers humanity puts in place to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETAILED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hyper-realistic world where every infection is influenced by a variety of factors, from climate and transportation to healthcare and population density.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/d3dd6baa25300bc99c382f1942667739.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/d3dd6baa25300bc99c382f1942667739.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/d3dd6baa25300bc99c382f1942667739.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>15 TYPES OF DISEASES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infect the world by choosing from 15 disease types, each with unique mutations and developmental possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/82b77d7884889c66ada1a0613144ffec.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/82b77d7884889c66ada1a0613144ffec.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/82b77d7884889c66ada1a0613144ffec.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LARGE INFECTION MAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infect all countries, interact with hundreds of traits, and create diverse virus-spreading scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/bba8d9ee6d54b1cfa221183ae8a0bbd4.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/bba8d9ee6d54b1cfa221183ae8a0bbd4.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/bba8d9ee6d54b1cfa221183ae8a0bbd4.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GLOBAL EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for global catastrophes and decide how to adapt your pathogen to government actions and changing conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/08c51bd0d6b4f38857d07944358b8353.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/08c51bd0d6b4f38857d07944358b8353.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/08c51bd0d6b4f38857d07944358b8353.mp4?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRATEGY AND TACTICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save the world or destroy it? Develop your plague, plan your moves, and determine the fate of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/f82d2737ef95d524ee0a25da86d80a93.poster.avif?t=1771487857\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624090/extras/f82d2737ef95d524ee0a25da86d80a93.webm?t=1771487857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/